# Xiao Faruzan Raiden Xianyun. ~24s Rot. Xiaoden Faruzan. Even with triple Anemo, Raiden can contribute to lowering energy requirements. TTDS Xianyun is the same. 11 plunges. 50% collisions.

# Team
# Team - Options listed by DPS
xiao char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
xiao add weapon="deathmatch" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
#xiao add weapon="prospectorsdrill" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
#xiao add weapon="missive" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
